Package: 0c-ime
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         python3,
         0c-ime-data (= ${source:Version})
Recommends: python3-numpy,
            python3-onnxruntime
Suggests: fcitx5-0c,
          ibus-0c
Description: Zhuyin (Bopomofo) input method engine
 0c-ime (靈犀注音) is a Traditional Chinese Zhuyin input method.  This package
 contains the shared engine, the update helper and the MCP command-line tool
 used by the desktop shells.
 .
 Neural candidate selection and punctuation are optional; without the
 separately packaged models the statistical engine is used.

Package: 0c-ime-data
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: dictionary data for the 0c-ime Zhuyin input method
 This package contains the compiled dictionary, the neural inference worker
 scripts and the update metadata used by 0c-ime.

Package: fcitx5-0c
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         fcitx5,
         0c-ime (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Fcitx5 input method engine for 0c-ime
 This package provides the Fcitx5 addon and input method definition for the
 0c-ime Zhuyin input method.

Package: ibus-0c
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ibus,
         0c-ime (= ${binary:Version})
Description: IBus input method engine for 0c-ime
 This package provides the IBus component and engine binary for the 0c-ime
 Zhuyin input method.
